# Each test under tests/ is a self-contained nested Bazel module; the outer
# workspace must not descend into them (they are built/tested on their own, see
# tests/ and .github/workflows/ci.yml). tests/repo_name in particular loads its
# dep under a renamed repo (@bcce), which is not visible from this module, so
# `//:refresh_all`'s `deps(@//...)` would fail to load the package otherwise.
tests/integration
tests/repo_name
